@* 🟢 «الأستاذ المساعد لمراكز التكلفة بالفترة المالية» كما فى الديسكتوب (Master_Account_CostCenter_TarsesdFRM) وبتصميم صفحة الأستاذ المساعد:
   الشبكة الأولى: المراكز التى لها حركات فى التاريخين (كود + اسم) مع بحث بالاسم؛ بالنقر على مركز تظهر حركته فى الشبكة الثانية (بحث فى «البيان»).
   المرشحات كالديسكتوب: الفرع، الفترة المالية (تغييرها يملأ التاريخين)، التاريخان، العملة، اليومية، نوع الحساب، وحساب اختيارى لقصر الحركة عليه.
   المحرك نفسه بلا تعديل: Get_MasterCostCenter_Details_TarseedNewNew (رصيد أول المدة من ترحيل المراكز + حركات الفترة حتى البداية).
   الديسكتوب يعيد بناء ترحيل المراكز عند كل «عرض»؛ هنا يُبنى تلقائياً فقط إن كان فارغاً للفترة والفرع، وزر «تحديث رصيد أول المدة» (صلاحية 318) يعيد بناءه بتأكيد.
   النقر المزدوج على سطر القيد يفتحه. *@
@page "/accounts/final/cost-center-ledger"

@using System.Globalization
@using AccountModelsLib
@using AccountModelsLib.BusinessLibShared.GeneralLedger
@using AccountERP.SharedUI.Services
@using AccountERP.SharedUI.Components.Shared
@inject LanguageService LangService
@inject IJSRuntime JS
@inject NavigationManager Nav
@implements IDisposable

<PageTitle>@Title</PageTitle>

<InvoiceStyles />

<style>
    .lg-head { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 16px 20px; }
    .lg-head .ico { flex: none; width: 56px; height: 56px; border-radius: 16px; display: grid; place-items: center;
                    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--mud-palette-primary) 14%, transparent); color: var(--mud-palette-primary); }
    .lg-head .ico .mud-icon-root { font-size: 2rem; }
    .lg-head .titles { flex: 1 1 260px; min-width: 0; }
    .lg-head .sub { margin-top: 4px; font-size: .875rem; color: var(--mud-palette-text-secondary); }
    .lg-gap { margin-top: 16px; }
    .lg-filters { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 12px; align-items: start; }
    .lg-filters .wide { grid-column: span 2; }
    .lg-btns { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 16px; margin-top: 12px; align-items: center; }
    .lg-split { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(280px, 340px) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 16px; align-items: start; }
    .lg-list { max-height: 68vh; overflow: auto; border: 1px solid var(--mud-palette-lines-default); border-radius: 8px; margin-top: 8px; }
    table.lg-acc { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; }
    table.lg-acc th, table.lg-acc td { padding: 6px 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--mud-palette-lines-default); }
    table.lg-acc thead th { position: sticky; top: 0; background: var(--mud-palette-surface); font-weight: 700; z-index: 1; text-align: start; }
    table.lg-acc tr.pick { cursor: pointer; }
    table.lg-acc tr.pick:hover td { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--mud-palette-primary) 8%, transparent); }
    table.lg-acc tr.sel td { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--mud-palette-primary) 18%, transparent); font-weight: 700; }
    .lg-wrap { overflow-x: auto; }
    table.lg { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
    table.lg th, table.lg td { padding: 6px 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--mud-palette-lines-default); white-space: nowrap; }
    table.lg thead th { position: sticky; top: 0; background: var(--mud-palette-surface); font-weight: 700; text-align: center; z-index: 1; }
    table.lg td.num { text-align: end; }
    table.lg td.txt { white-space: normal; min-width: 180px; }
    table.lg tr.move { cursor: pointer; }
    table.lg tr.move:hover td { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--mud-palette-primary) 8%, transparent); }
    table.lg tr.open td { font-weight: 700; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--mud-palette-primary) 8%, transparent); }
    table.lg tr.tot td { font-weight: 700; border-top: 1px solid var(--mud-palette-text-secondary); }
    table.lg tr.close td { font-weight: 800; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--mud-palette-primary) 16%, transparent); border-top: 2px solid var(--mud-palette-primary); }
    .lg-acc-title { font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.05rem; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px 24px; align-items: baseline; }
    .lg-acc-title .cur { font-weight: 400; color: var(--mud-palette-text-secondary); font-size: .9rem; }
    .lg-print-title { display: none; }
    @@media (max-width: 1099px) { .lg-filters { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); } .lg-split { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); } .lg-list { max-height: 40vh; } }
    @@media (max-width: 599px) { .lg-filters { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); } .lg-filters .wide { grid-column: auto; } }
    @@media print {
        .lg-noprint, .mud-appbar, .mud-drawer, nav { display: none !important; }
        .lg-split { display: block; }
        .lg-print-title { display: block; margin-bottom: 8px; }
        .lg-wrap { overflow: visible; }
        table.lg thead th { position: static; }
    }
</style>

<MudContainer MaxWidth="MaxWidth.False" Class="mt-4" Style="@($"direction: {(LangService.IsRtl ? "rtl" : "ltr")};")">
<div class="inv-page" @onkeydown="OnKeyDown">

    <div class="inv-card lg-head lg-noprint">
        <div class="ico" aria-hidden="true"><MudIcon Icon="@Icons.Material.Filled.MenuBook" /></div>
        <div class="titles">
            <h1 class="inv-title">@Title</h1>
            <div class="sub">@Tr("CCLSub")</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="inv-card lg-gap lg-noprint">
        <h2 class="inv-card-title"><MudIcon Icon="@Icons.Material.Filled.FilterList" />@Tr("SOFiltersTitle")</h2>
        <div class="lg-filters">
            <MudSelect T="long" Value="_branch" ValueChanged="OnBranchAsync" Label="@Tr("FABranch")" Variant="Variant.Outlined"
                       ToStringFunc="@(v => _branches.FirstOrDefault(b => b.Id == v)?.Name ?? "")">
                @foreach (var b in _branches)
                {
                    <MudSelectItem T="long" Value="@b.Id">@b.Name</MudSelectItem>
                }
            </MudSelect>
                <MudSelect T="long" Value="_periodId" ValueChanged="OnPeriodAsync" Label="@Tr("FAPeriod")" Variant="Variant.Outlined" ToStringFunc="@(v => PeriodText(v))">
                    @foreach (var p in _periods)
                    {
                        <MudSelectItem T="long" Value="@p.Id">@PeriodText(p.Id)</MudSelectItem>
                    }
                </MudSelect>
            <MudDatePicker T="DateTime?" Date="_from" DateChanged="OnFromAsync" Label="@Tr("FADateFrom")" Variant="Variant.Outlined" Editable="true" />
            <MudDatePicker T="DateTime?" Date="_to" DateChanged="@(d => { _to = d; Reset(); })" Label="@Tr("FADateTo")" Variant="Variant.Outlined" Editable="true" />
            <MudSelect T="long" Value="_currency" ValueChanged="@(v => { _currency = v; Reset(); })" Label="@Tr("FACurrency")" Variant="Variant.Outlined"
                       ToStringFunc="@(v => _currencies.FirstOrDefault(c => c.Id == v)?.Name ?? "")">
                @foreach (var c in _currencies)
                {
                    <MudSelectItem T="long" Value="@c.Id">@c.Name</MudSelectItem>
                }
            </MudSelect>
            <MudSelect T="long" Value="_journal" ValueChanged="@(v => { _journal = v; Reset(); })" Label="@Tr("LGJournal")" Variant="Variant.Outlined"
                       ToStringFunc="@(v => _journals.FirstOrDefault(j => j.Id == v)?.Name ?? "")">
                @foreach (var j in _journals)
                {
                    <MudSelectItem T="long" Value="@j.Id">@j.Name</MudSelectItem>
                }
            </MudSelect>
            <MudSelect T="long" Value="_accountType" ValueChanged="@(v => { _accountType = v; Reset(); })" Label="@Tr("LGAccountType")" Variant="Variant.Outlined"
                       ToStringFunc="@(v => _types.FirstOrDefault(t => t.Id == v)?.Name ?? "")">
                @foreach (var t in _types)
                {
                    <MudSelectItem T="long" Value="@t.Id">@t.Name</MudSelectItem>
                }
            </MudSelect>
            <div class="wide">
                <AccountSelector @key="_selectorKey" ShowPartyChoice="false" AccountSelection="0" BranchId="_branch"
                                 SubAccountId="_filterAccountId" SubAccountIdChanged="@(v => { _filterAccountId = v; Reset(); })"
                                 SubAccountName="_filterAccountName" SubAccountNameChanged="@(v => _filterAccountName = v)" />
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="lg-btns">
            <MudButton Variant="Variant.Filled" Color="Color.Primary" StartIcon="@Icons.Material.Filled.Visibility"
                       Disabled="@_loading" OnClick="ShowListAsync">@Tr("FAShow")</MudButton>
            @if (_canUpdateBalance)
            {
                <MudButton Variant="Variant.Outlined" StartIcon="@Icons.Material.Filled.Sync" Disabled="@_loading" OnClick="UpdateFirstBalanceAsync">@Tr("CCLUpdateFirstBalance")</MudButton>
            }
            <MudButton Variant="Variant.Text" StartIcon="@Icons.Material.Filled.Clear" Disabled="@(_filterAccountId == 0)" OnClick="ClearAccount">@Tr("LGClearAccount")</MudButton>
            <MudButton Variant="Variant.Outlined" StartIcon="@Icons.Material.Filled.Print"
                       Disabled="@(_loading || _lines == null)" OnClick="PrintAsync">@Tr("FAPrint")</MudButton>
            @if (_loading) { <MudProgressCircular Indeterminate="true" Size="Size.Small" /> }
        </div>
    </div>

    @if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(_error))
    {
        <MudAlert Severity="Severity.Error" Dense="true" Class="lg-gap" role="alert">@_error</MudAlert>
    }

    @if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(_info))
    {
        <MudAlert Severity="Severity.Info" Dense="true" Class="lg-gap" role="status">@_info</MudAlert>
    }

    @if (_list != null)
    {
        <div class="lg-split lg-gap">
            <div class="inv-card lg-noprint">
                <h2 class="inv-card-title"><MudIcon Icon="@Icons.Material.Filled.AccountTree" />@Tr("CCLCentersGrid") (@VisibleCenters.Count())</h2>
                <MudTextField T="string" @bind-Value="_accountSearch" Immediate="true" Label="@Tr("TBSearch")" Variant="Variant.Outlined" Dense="true"
                              Adornment="Adornment.Start" AdornmentIcon="@Icons.Material.Filled.Search" Clearable="true" />
                <div class="lg-list">
                    <table class="lg-acc">
                        <thead><tr><th>@Tr("CCRColCenterCode")</th><th>@Tr("JECostCenterLabel")</th></tr></thead>
                        <tbody>
                            @foreach (var a in VisibleCenters)
                            {
                                <tr class="pick @(a.Id == _selectedId ? "sel" : "")" @onclick="@(() => SelectCenterAsync(a))">
                                    <td>@a.Code</td><td>@a.Name</td>
                                </tr>
                            }
                        </tbody>
                    </table>
                </div>
                @if (_list.Count == 0)
                {
                    <MudAlert Severity="Severity.Info" Dense="true" Class="lg-gap" role="status">@Tr("CCLNoCenters")</MudAlert>
                }
            </div>

            <div class="inv-card">
                @if (_lines == null)
                {
                    <MudAlert Severity="Severity.Info" Dense="true" role="status">@Tr("CCLPickCenter")</MudAlert>
                }
                else
                {
                    <div class="lg-print-title">
                        <strong>@Title</strong> — @_shownName — @_shownCurrency
                        (@_from?.ToString("yyyy/MM/dd") → @_to?.ToString("yyyy/MM/dd"))
                    </div>
                    <div class="lg-acc-title">
                        <span>@_shownName</span><span class="cur">@Tr("FACurrency"): @_shownCurrency</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="lg-noprint lg-gap">
                        <MudTextField T="string" @bind-Value="_notesSearch" Immediate="true" Label="@Tr("LGSearchNotes")" Variant="Variant.Outlined" Dense="true"
                                      Adornment="Adornment.Start" AdornmentIcon="@Icons.Material.Filled.Search" Clearable="true" />
                    </div>
                    <div class="lg-wrap lg-gap">
                        <table class="lg">
                            <thead>
                                <tr>
                                    <th>@Tr("LGColSerial")</th><th>@Tr("LGColDate")</th><th>@Tr("LGColEntryNo")</th><th>@Tr("LGJournal")</th>
                                    <th>@Tr("TBColAccount")</th><th>@Tr("FACurrency")</th>
                                    <th>@Tr("LGColNotes")</th><th>@Tr("LGColDebit")</th><th>@Tr("LGColCredit")</th>
                                    <th>@Tr("LGColBalDebit")</th><th>@Tr("LGColBalCredit")</th>
                                </tr>
                            </thead>
                            <tbody>
                                @{ int serial = 0; }
                                @foreach (var l in VisibleLines)
                                {
                                    if (l.Kind == 0)
                                    {
                                        serial++;
                                        <tr class="move" title="@Tr("LGOpenHint")" @ondblclick="@(() => OpenEntry(l))">
                                            <td>@serial</td>
                                            <td>@l.Date?.ToString("yyyy/MM/dd")</td>
                                            <td>@l.EntryNo</td><td>@l.Journal</td>
                                            <td class="txt">@l.OtherAccount</td><td>@l.Currency</td><td class="txt">@l.Notes</td>
                                            <td class="num">@N(l.Debit)</td><td class="num">@N(l.Credit)</td>
                                            <td class="num">@N(l.BalanceDebit)</td><td class="num">@N(l.BalanceCredit)</td>
                                        </tr>
                                    }
                                    else
                                    {
                                        <tr class="@(l.Kind == 1 ? "open" : l.Kind == 2 ? "tot" : "close")">
                                            <td colspan="6"></td>
                                            <td>@l.Notes</td>
                                            <td class="num">@N(l.Debit)</td><td class="num">@N(l.Credit)</td>
                                            <td class="num">@N(l.BalanceDebit)</td><td class="num">@N(l.BalanceCredit)</td>
                                        </tr>
                                    }
                                }
                            </tbody>
                        </table>
                    </div>
                    @if (_lines.All(l => l.Kind != 0))
                    {
                        <MudAlert Severity="Severity.Info" Dense="true" Class="lg-gap" role="status">@Tr("LGNoMoves")</MudAlert>
                    }
                }
            </div>
        </div>
    }
</div>
</MudContainer>

@code {
    private readonly FinalAccountsService _svc = new();
    private List<FinalAccountsService.PeriodRow> _periods = new();
    private List<FinalAccountsService.Option> _branches = new(), _currencies = new(), _journals = new(), _types = new();
    private List<FinalAccountsService.CostCenterItem>? _list;
    private long _periodId, _branch, _journal, _accountType, _currency = FinalAccountsService.EquivalentCurrencyId;
    private long _filterAccountId, _selectedId;
    private string _filterAccountName = "";
    private int _selectorKey;
    private DateTime? _from, _to;
    private string _accountSearch = "", _notesSearch = "";
    private List<FinalAccountsService.LedgerLine>? _lines;
    private string _shownName = "", _shownCurrency = "";
    private string? _error, _info;
    private bool _loading, _canUpdateBalance;

    private string Title => Tr("CCLTitle");

    private IEnumerable<FinalAccountsService.CostCenterItem> VisibleCenters =>
        _list == null ? Enumerable.Empty<FinalAccountsService.CostCenterItem>()
        : string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(_accountSearch) ? _list
        : _list.Where(a => a.Name.Contains(_accountSearch.Trim(), StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase) || a.Code.Contains(_accountSearch.Trim(), StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase));

    // بحث «البيان» يصفّى كل الصفوف بما فيها المجاميع كما يفعل RowFilter فى الديسكتوب
    private IEnumerable<FinalAccountsService.LedgerLine> VisibleLines =>
        string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(_notesSearch) ? _lines!
        : _lines!.Where(l => l.Notes.Contains(_notesSearch.Trim(), StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase));

    protected override async Task OnInitializedAsync()
    {
        LangService.OnLanguageChanged += OnLanguageChangedHandler;
        try
        {
            string equivalent = Tr("TBEquivalent"), allJournals = Tr("LGAllJournals"), allTypes = Tr("LGAllTypes");
            await Task.Run(() =>
            {
                AccountCultureGuard.EnsureInvariant();
                _periods = _svc.GetPeriods();
                _branches = _svc.GetBranches();
                _currencies = _svc.GetCurrencies(equivalent);
                _journals = _svc.GetJournals(allJournals);
                _types = _svc.GetAccountTypes(allTypes);
            });
            var today = DateTime.Today;
            var cur = _periods.FirstOrDefault(p => p.IsActive)
                      ?? _periods.FirstOrDefault(p => p.DateFrom <= today && today <= p.DateTo) ?? _periods.LastOrDefault();
            _periodId = cur?.Id ?? 0;
            _from = cur?.DateFrom; _to = cur?.DateTo;
            _branch = _branches.Any(b => b.Id == AccountModelsLib.Common.Branch_Id) ? AccountModelsLib.Common.Branch_Id : _branches.FirstOrDefault()?.Id ?? 0;
            _canUpdateBalance = AccountModelsLib.Common.IsHavePermission(AccountModelsLib.Common.User_Id, 318, 9, AccountModelsLib.Common.Branch_Id);
        }
        catch (Exception ex) { _error = Tr("SystemError", Inner(ex)); }
    }

    private void OnLanguageChangedHandler() => InvokeAsync(StateHasChanged);
    public void Dispose() => LangService.OnLanguageChanged -= OnLanguageChangedHandler;

    private void Reset() { _list = null; _lines = null; _selectedId = 0; _error = null; _info = null; }

    private void OnBranchAsync(long id) { _branch = id; ClearAccount(); }

    private void ClearAccount() { _filterAccountId = 0; _filterAccountName = ""; _selectorKey++; Reset(); }

    private void OnPeriodAsync(long id)
    {
        _periodId = id;
        var p = _periods.FirstOrDefault(x => x.Id == id);
        _from = p?.DateFrom; _to = p?.DateTo; Reset();
    }

    // كما فى الديسكتوب: الفترة المالية المعروضة تتبع تاريخ البداية
    private void OnFromAsync(DateTime? d)
    {
        _from = d; Reset();
        if (d != null)
        {
            var p = _periods.FirstOrDefault(x => x.DateFrom.Date <= d.Value.Date && d.Value.Date <= x.DateTo.Date);
            if (p != null) _periodId = p.Id;
        }
    }

    private string PeriodText(long id)
    {
        var p = _periods.FirstOrDefault(x => x.Id == id);
        if (p == null) return "";
        return string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(p.Name) ? $"{p.DateFrom:yyyy/MM/dd} — {p.DateTo:yyyy/MM/dd}" : p.Name;
    }

    private async Task OnKeyDown(KeyboardEventArgs e)
    {
        if (e.Key == "F8") await ShowListAsync();
    }

    // ValidateDate فى الديسكتوب: اختيار الفترة، والتاريخان داخلها
    private string? ValidateFilters(out FinalAccountsService.PeriodRow? period)
    {
        period = _periods.FirstOrDefault(p => p.Id == _periodId);
        if (period == null || _from == null || _to == null) return Tr("FAErrPeriodRequired");
        if (_to.Value.Date < _from.Value.Date) return Tr("FAErrToBeforeFrom");
        if (_from.Value.Date < period.DateFrom.Date || _to.Value.Date > period.DateTo.Date) return Tr("CCLErrOutsidePeriod");
        return null;
    }

    private async Task ShowListAsync()
    {
        _error = null; _info = null; _lines = null; _list = null; _selectedId = 0;
        var err = ValidateFilters(out var period);
        if (err != null) { _error = err; return; }
        _loading = true;
        try
        {
            DateTime from = _from!.Value, to = _to!.Value; long jr = _journal, br = _branch, cur = _currency, acc = _filterAccountId; int type = (int)_accountType;
            int currencyCount = _currencies.Count;
            string? refreshError = null;
            _list = await Task.Run(() =>
            {
                AccountCultureGuard.EnsureInvariant();
                // الديسكتوب يعيد بناء ترحيل المراكز عند كل عرض؛ هنا يُبنى تلقائياً فقط إذا كان فارغاً للفترة والفرع (لا حذف)
                refreshError = _svc.RefreshCostCenterFirstBalance(period!, br, cur, currencyCount, onlyIfEmpty: true);
                return _svc.GetCostCenterLedgerCenters(from, to, jr, br, cur, type, acc);
            });
            _info = refreshError;
        }
        catch (Exception ex) { _error = Tr("SystemError", Inner(ex)); }
        finally { _loading = false; }
    }

    private async Task UpdateFirstBalanceAsync()
    {
        _error = null; _info = null;
        var period = _periods.FirstOrDefault(p => p.Id == _periodId);
        if (period == null) { _error = Tr("FAErrPeriodRequired"); return; }
        if (!await JS.InvokeAsync<bool>("confirm", Tr("CCLUpdateConfirm"))) return;
        _loading = true;
        try
        {
            long br = _branch, cur = _currency; int currencyCount = _currencies.Count;
            var msg = await Task.Run(() => { AccountCultureGuard.EnsureInvariant(); return _svc.RefreshCostCenterFirstBalance(period, br, cur, currencyCount, onlyIfEmpty: false); });
            if (msg != null) _error = msg; else _info = Tr("CCLUpdatedOk");
            _lines = null;
        }
        catch (Exception ex) { _error = Tr("SystemError", Inner(ex)); }
        finally { _loading = false; }
    }

    private async Task SelectCenterAsync(FinalAccountsService.CostCenterItem center)
    {
        _error = null; _lines = null; _selectedId = center.Id; _notesSearch = "";
        var err = ValidateFilters(out var period);
        if (err != null) { _error = err; return; }
        _loading = true;
        try
        {
            long cur = _currency, jr = _journal, br = _branch, acc = _filterAccountId, id = center.Id; DateTime from = _from!.Value, to = _to!.Value;
            _lines = await Task.Run(() =>
            {
                AccountCultureGuard.EnsureInvariant();
                return _svc.GetCostCenterLedger(period!, id, from, to, cur, jr, br, acc);
            });
            _shownName = $"( {center.Code} ) {center.Name}".Trim();
            _shownCurrency = _currencies.FirstOrDefault(c => c.Id == _currency)?.Name ?? "";
        }
        catch (Exception ex) { _error = Tr("SystemError", Inner(ex)); }
        finally { _loading = false; }
    }

    private void OpenEntry(FinalAccountsService.LedgerLine l)
    {
        if (l.EntryId <= 0) return;
        bool columns = AccountModelsLib.Common.IsHavePermission(AccountModelsLib.Common.User_Id, 808, 2, AccountModelsLib.Common.Branch_Id);
        Nav.NavigateTo(columns ? $"/accounts/journal-entry/madin-da2n?id={l.EntryId}" : $"/accounts/journal-entry?id={l.EntryId}");
    }

    private async Task PrintAsync() => await JS.InvokeVoidAsync("window.print");

    private static string N(decimal v) => v == 0 ? "" : v.ToString("N2", CultureInfo.InvariantCulture);

    private static string Inner(Exception ex) { while (ex.InnerException != null) ex = ex.InnerException; return ex.Message; }

    private string Tr(string key, params object[] args)
    {
        var previousCulture = CultureInfo.CurrentUICulture;
        try
        {
            CultureInfo.CurrentUICulture = LangService.CurrentCultureInfo;
            return Lang[key, args];
        }
        finally
        {
            CultureInfo.CurrentUICulture = previousCulture;
        }
    }
}
